    10  - Source archive SHA-256: `ce62bfbdb22681ba48b2a04653155b2e06f52659f140c13f5e0220db365b9250`
    11  - Manuscript PDF SHA-256: `f68142b3d99b95f83ca6ba4688539cb9e0fdb88ed96809aef5316ed22a59888f`
    12  - Internal source-archive members: 19
