   111	        "Pendant synchronization and pendant initialization",
   112	        "Reciprocal killed-Green bounds",
   113	        "Reciprocal hub-excursion renewal",
   114	        r"I-Q(r)$ is a nonsingular $M$-matrix",
   115	        r"\mathcal E_C=\{R\leq\delta c\}",
