 1501 Conceptualization, formal analysis, methodology, software, validation,
 1502 visualization, and writing: A.K.  The author determined the scope and claims
 1503 and accepts responsibility for the proof, software, and manuscript.
 1504 
 1505 \medskip
 1506 \noindent\textbf{Ethics approval and consent.}
 1507 Not applicable.  This study uses no human participants, animals, or empirical
 1508 biological data.
 1509 
 1510 \medskip
 1511 \noindent\textbf{AI-assisted research disclosure.}
 1512 Generative-AI systems were used substantively in mathematical exploration,
 1513 derivation, adversarial proof analysis, software development, and manuscript
 1514 preparation.  The author determined the scope and claims and accepts
 1515 responsibility for the manuscript and accompanying materials.  All exact
 1516 certificates are supplied for independent replay, and numerical evidence is
 1517 explicitly separated from proof.
